          "to": "𐎌𐎓𐎗𐎚 šʿrt (šaʿratu) 'wool'"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Semitic *ʕaśar- 'ten'",
          "to": "𐎓𐎌𐎗 ʿšr (ʿašru) 'ten'"
